      // took on this afternoon and has not finished giving back. A horizontal face took the
      // same load whatever compass direction it "points", so the azimuthal aspect has to be
      // gated on how far the surface is tilted OFF horizontal \u2014 and shaded relief on open
      // ground is exactly the directional-lighting look BAR \xA76 forbids.
      //
