      // degree banks, so every landform was toned as if it were flat and the wadi had to be
      // rebuilt out of near-vertical faces to read at all. Gate on the SINE of the tilt (the
      // surface's horizontal gradient magnitude \u2014 0.42 at 25 degrees) with a knee: below
