      // 0245 is nothing like uniform: gravel, sand, rock shelf, disturbed soil, old field
      // boundaries, wheel tracks and damp low ground all read differently, at every scale
      // from a hundred metres down to a few. Three octaves, world space, so the signature
      // crosses object boundaries the way ground actually does.
