      // structural band was 0.18 wide and sat just under it. The band is now 0.275 wide
      // (REALISM \xA74.4: roofs and vegetation DARK, dirt and roads BRIGHT), so an absolute knee
      // would either bite the road population or let a mud wall \u2014 perturbed x1.5 by the form
      // terms \u2014 climb straight through the middle of the band and out-brighten the dirt it
      // stands on. That would destroy the one thing this round is for: the ORDER of the
      // surfaces. Bounding the EXCURSION instead keeps every surface inside its own
