    // swing with the whole PSF stage switched off as with it on, so nothing downstream is
    // amplifying it, and _f9bloom's own MSAA ladder measures 1.48 heat at 0 samples, 0.48 at
    // 4 and 0.39 at 8 \u2014 coverage sampling converges far too slowly to reach the 0.127-heat
