    // volume is proportional to |dot(N, V)| at the entry point \u2014 exactly, for a sphere \u2014 so
    // Beer-Lambert on that chord gives an opacity that goes smoothly to ZERO at the limb.
    // The fragments whose coverage is uncertain are then the ones contributing nothing, and
    // the detector's value stops depending on which side of a sample point the silhouette
